{"meta":{"id":"tt43691315","type":"series","name":"From Far Away","imdb_id":"tt43691315","description":"Un día, de camino a casa del colegio, Noriko es arrastrada inesperadamente a un extraño y extraordinario mundo de fantasía. Sus problemas se multiplican exponencialmente cuando es rescatada y se hace amiga de un apuesto joven llamado Izark.\n\nPuede que sea valiente y valeroso, pero en el interior de Izark acecha el mal más oscuro imaginable. Y según una antigua profecía, Noriko posee el poder de desatar ese mal. Ahora, inexorablemente unidos, estos dos improbables aliados deben navegar por un mundo maravilloso y hostil a la vez.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt43691315.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/inwM4LXqXYYauU1eJkfJ6uDkV11.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s0u1AgZ9k2N4TOpnudYwb3bXoxt.png","genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"Japan","cast":["黒沢ともよ","熊谷健太郎","梅原裕一郎","竹内栄治","斉藤貴美子"],"writer":["たかすぎ梨香","ひかわきょうこ"],"trailers":[{"source":"KvAT3meev84","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"KvAT3meev84","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"KvAT3meev84","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"6.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt43691315"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"黒沢ともよ","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?sea